  "description": "Request, SQL query, log, and exception capture for ASP.NET Core, viewable in a dashboard served at /_debug. Inspired by Laravel Telescope. LiteDB storage, EF Core interceptor, zero-config setup.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "AspNetDebugDashboard",
